sequenceDiagram
  participant Page as Workbench page
  participant Core as Core session
  Page->>Core: Open: grammar text, optional trace file text
  Core-->>Page: a session, or the diagnostics
  Page->>Core: Insert: a step right after the steps read
  Page->>Core: Read: the next step
  alt a reading accepts the step
    Core-->>Page: the new state
  else no reading accepts the step
    Core-->>Page: the failure point, and the state before it
  end
  Page->>Core: State
  Core-->>Page: counts, next options, the position of each reading
  Page->>Core: Tree: the reading on view
  Core-->>Page: its tree, with the origins of each node
  Page->>Core: Back
  Core-->>Page: the state of a new trace of the shorter prefix
  Page->>Core: Save
  Core-->>Page: the trace file, as KDL text
